---
const links = ["How it works", "Security", "Pricing", "Docs", "Privacy", "Terms"];
const hrefs = ["#gate", "#", "#pricing", "#", "#", "#"];
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="f-top">
      <a href="/" class="mark" style="font-size:19px">Zone<i>steward</i></a>
      <div class="f-links">{links.map((l, i) => <a href={hrefs[i]}>{l}</a>)}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="colophon">
      Built by one person who runs a fleet of Cloudflare zones for an agency,
      because the dashboard assumes you only have one. Set in Newsreader and
      Geist. Not affiliated with Cloudflare, Inc.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
